---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | CoursesWyn"
  description="CoursesWyn Terms of Service. Legal terms and conditions for using our Udemy coupon platform."
  canonical="https://courseswyn.com/terms"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": "https://courseswyn.com/terms",
        "url": "https://courseswyn.com/terms",
        "name": "Terms of Service | CoursesWyn",
        "description": "Legal terms and conditions for using CoursesWyn.",
        "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://courseswyn.com" },
        "dateModified": "2026-07-27",
        "inLanguage": "en-US",
        "breadcrumb": {
          "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
          "itemListElement": [
            { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://courseswyn.com" },
            { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Terms of Service", "item": "https://courseswyn.com/terms" }
          ]
        },
        "mainEntity": { "@type": "WebPage", "name": "Terms of Service" }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "@id": "https://courseswyn.com/#organization",
        "name": "CoursesWyn",
        "url": "https://courseswyn.com",
        "sameAs": ["https://x.com/CoursesWyn", "https://www.facebook.com/CoursesWyn"]
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <main class="p-root">
    <article class="p-article">

      <header class="p-hdr">
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="p-date">Last updated: July 27, 2026</p>
      </header>

      <section class="p-intro">
        <p>PLEASE READ THESE TERMS CAREFULLY. BY ACCESSING COURSESWYN.COM YOU ACCEPT THEM.</p>
        <p>These Terms of Service govern your use of CoursesWyn, a Udemy coupon directory. We are independent from Udemy and have no commercial relationship with them.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr"><h2>1. Service Description</h2></div>
        <p>CoursesWyn aggregates publicly available coupon codes and price data for online courses, primarily on Udemy. We are independent from Udemy and have no commercial relationship with them.</p>
        <p>The service may be accessed through the CoursesWyn website or compatible third-party products. A third-party product may summarize or display CoursesWyn results differently; its own terms also apply to your use of that product.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr"><h2>2. Eligibility</h2></div>
        <p>You must be 13 years or older to use this service. You are responsible for your activity on CoursesWyn.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr"><h2>3. Acceptable Use</h2></div>
        <ul>
          <li>No automated scraping or data collection without explicit permission.</li>
          <li>No bypassing access controls or redirect protections.</li>
          <li>No posting unlawful, defamatory, or infringing content.</li>
          <li>We may block access for violations of these rules.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr"><h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2></div>
        <p>The CoursesWyn name, logo, and site code are our property. Udemy is a registered trademark of Udemy, Inc.; used here for descriptive purposes only.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr"><h2>5. Disclaimer</h2></div>
        <p>We make reasonable efforts to display accurate prices and coupons but do not guarantee uninterrupted availability or accuracy. Content is provided "AS IS", without warranties of any kind.</p>
        <p>Course and coupon availability can change between the moment you view a deal on CoursesWyn and the moment you open the third-party course page. The course platform confirms the final price, eligibility, and availability.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr"><h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2></div>
        <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, CoursesWyn shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the service.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr"><h2>7. Third-Party Links & Ads</h2></div>
        <p>Our site may display advertisements. Any dealings with advertisers are solely between you and the advertiser.</p>
        <p>Some CoursesWyn results include attributed or tracked links. Opening an external course link is always your choice. CoursesWyn is not responsible for the availability, content, billing, or privacy practices of Udemy or any third-party service.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr"><h2>8. Termination</h2></div>
        <p>We may block or restrict access to CoursesWyn for violations of these Terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr"><h2>9. Changes to Terms</h2></div>
        <p>We may update these Terms; continued use after the effective date constitutes acceptance.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr"><h2>10. Governing Law</h2></div>
        <p>These Terms are governed by applicable law; exclusive jurisdiction lies with the relevant courts.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr"><h2>Contact</h2></div>
        <p class="p-contact">
          CoursesWyn<br>
          Email: hello@courseswyn.com<br>
          Web: <a href="/contact">courseswyn.com/contact</a>
        </p>
      </section>

    </article>
  </main>

  <style>
    .p-root { padding: 3rem 1rem 4rem; }
    .p-article { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; }

    .p-hdr { }
    .p-hdr h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0; line-height: 1.15; }
    .p-date { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; }

    .p-intro p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
    .p-intro p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }

    .p-sec-hdr { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.5rem 0; margin: 0; }
    .p-sec-hdr h2 { font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--text); margin: 0; }

    section p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; }

    section ul { list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; margin: 0; }
    section li { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }

    .p-contact { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
    .p-contact a { color: var(--brand); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
    .p-contact a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .p-root { padding: 2rem 1rem 3rem; }
      .p-hdr h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>